{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-1","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Observations of wisdom and folly; 16 of riot; 18 slothfulness; 19 and money. 20 Men's thoughts of kings ought to be reverent.</p>\n<p>Dead flies. Heb. Flies of death. the ointment Ex 30:34,35 a little. 2Ch 19:2; Ne 6:13; 13:26; Mt 5:13-16; Ga 2:12-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-2","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>wise. 9:10; Pr 14:8; Lu 14:28-32 but. 10,14; Pr 17:16; Lu 12:18-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-3","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>wisdom. Heb. heart. and he. 5:3; Pr 13:16; 18:2,6; 1Pe 4:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-4","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>leave. 8:3 for. 1Sa 25:24-44; Pr 25:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-5","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>an evil. 4:7; 5:13; 6:1; 9:3 as an. 3:16; 4:1 from. Heb. from before.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-6","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Folly. Jud 9:14-20; 1Ki 12:13,14; Es 3:1; Ps 12:8; Pr 28:12,28 dignity. Heb. heights. the rich. Jas 2:3-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-7","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Pr 19:10; 30:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-8","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>that. Jud 9:5,53-57; 2Sa 17:23; 18:15; Es 7:10; Ps 7:15,16; 9:15,16 Pr 26:27 a serpent. Am 5:19; 9:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-10","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>wisdom. 15; 9:15-17; Ge 41:33-39; Ex 18:19-23; 1Ki 3:9; 1Ch 12:32 2Ch 23:4-11; Mt 10:16; Ac 6:1-9; 15:2-21; Ro 16:19; 1Co 14:20 Eph 5:15-17; Col 4:5; Jas 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-11","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the serpent. Ps 58:4,5; Jer 8:17 a babbler. Heb. the master of the tongue. Ps 52:2; 64:3; Pr 18:21; Jas 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-12","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>words. Job 4:3,4; 16:5; Ps 37:30; 40:9,10; 71:15-18; Pr 10:13,20,21,31,32 Pr 12:13,14,18; 15:2,23; 16:21-24; 22:17,18; 25:11,12; 31:26 Mt 12:35; Lu 4:22; Eph 4:29; Col 4:6 gracious. Heb. grace. but. 2Sa 1:16; 1Ki 20:40-42; Ps 64:8; 140:9; Pr 10:8,10,14; 18:6-8; 19:5 Pr 26:9; Lu 19:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-13","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>beginning. Jud 14:15; 1Sa 20:26-33; 22:7,8,16-18; 25:10,11; 2Sa 19:41-43 2Sa 20:1; 2Ki 6:27,31; Pr 29:9; Mt 2:7,8,16; Lu 6:2,11 Lu 11:38,53,54; Joh 12:10; Ac 5:28-33; 6:9-11; 7:54-59; 19:24-28 talk. Heb. mouth.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-14","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>fool. 5:3; Pr 10:19; 15:2 is full of words. Heb. multiplieth words. Job 34:37; 35:16 a man. 3:22; 6:12; 8:7; Jas 4:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-15","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>labour. 3,10; Isa 44:12-17; 47:12,13; 55:2; 57:1; Hab 2:6; Mt 11:28-30 because. Ps 107:4,7; Isa 35:8-10; Jer 50:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-16","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>when. 2Ch 13:7; 33:1-20; 36:2,5,9,11; Isa 3:4,5,12 and. Pr 20:1,2; Isa 5:11,12; 28:7,8; Ho 7:5-7 in the. Jer 21:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-17","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>when. 6,7; Pr 28:2,3; Jer 30:21 and thy. Pr 31:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-18","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Pr 12:24; 14:1; 20:4; 21:25; 23:21; 24:30,31; Heb 6:11; 2Pe 1:5-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-19","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>feast. 2:1,2; 7:2-6; Ge 43:34; Da 5:1-12; 1Pe 4:3 and wine. 9:7; Ps 104:15; Isa 24:11; 1Sa 25:36; 2Sa 13:28; Lu 12:19 Eph 5:18,19 maketh merry. Heb. maketh glad the life. but.Money which would have answered every good purpose, and served for every emergency, is too often spent in feastings and revellings.</p>\n<p>7:11,12; 1Ch 21:24; 29:2-9; 2Ch 24:11-14; Ezr 1:6; 7:15-18; Ne 5:8 Ps 112:9; Isa 23:18; Mt 17:27; 19:21; Lu 8:3; 16:9; Ac 2:45; 11:29 Php 4:15-19; 1Ti 6:17-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-10-20","title":"Ecclesiastes 10:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":10,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":10,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Curse. Ex 22:28; Isa 8:21; Ac 23:5 thought. or, conscience. 7:21,22; Lu 19:40 in thy bedchamber. Lu 10:40; 12:2,3</p>"}]}